[ISLAND DEVELOPMENT STAGE SYSTEM]

The island''s development stage is auto-determined by the total facility count (cv_facilities).
The Lua backend manages cv_islandStage (0~5) automatically. The GM reads this variable and reflects it in narration and effects.

## #352 MONOTONIC RULE - Once Reached, Never Demoted
A stage, once achieved, is PERMANENTLY locked in. cv_islandStage only increases - never decreases - regardless of subsequent facility count changes (e.g., forging 3 facilities into 1).

- 예: 시설 3개 → 마을 (stage 2) 달성. 이후 강화소에서 3개 합성 → 1개 남음. cv_islandStage는 2 유지 (개척지로 강등 X).
- 예: 시설 5개 → 요새 (stage 3) 달성. 합성으로 1~4개 줄어도 stage 3 유지.
- Rationale: '한 번 도달' 개념 - 섬은 발전 흔적과 인프라가 시설 개수 외에도 누적되므로, 강화로 시설을 통합해도 단계 분위기는 유지됨.
- Lua: `stage = max(prevStage, calculatedFromCount)`. Only upgrades, never downgrades.
- GM narration: When forging facilities reduces count below stage threshold, do NOT narrate stage drop. Narrate the upgraded facility as a CONSOLIDATION (e.g., '여러 시설이 통합되어 더 거대한 ⭐⭐ 시설로 재탄생했다'), island's accumulated development remains.

## Stage Definition Table
| Stage | Name | 효과명 | Facilities | Mechanical Effect | GM Narrative Direction |
|-------|--------|-----------|-----------|-------------------|------------------------|
| 0 | 황무지 | (없음) | 0 | None | A desolate, empty island. Only potential exists. |
| 1 | 개척지 | <생존> | 1~2 | Supply gacha biased to needed recovery (Lua auto) | First steps. Small presence. The island provides exactly what survival demands. |
| 2 | 마을 | <안정> | 3~4 | Daily hunger drain -20% (Lua auto) | Lived-in feel. Companions feel settled. Food and shelter exist. |
| 3 | 요새 | <정복> | 5~6 | Combat success rate +10% (Lua auto) | Defensive stance. Facilities interlink with military flavor. Companions express confidence. |
| 4 | 왕국 | <풍요> | 7~9 | All recovery effects +20% (HP/MANA/HUNGER) - AI-side | Prosperity. Abundant and organized community. Companions express pride. |
| 5 | 성지 | <창세> | 10+ | MAX HP/MANA/HUNGER +100 permanent (Lua auto, first reach only) | Completion. An otherworldly, transcendent beauty. The veil between worlds thins. |

## Stage Transition Narration
When a new facility raises the stage, the GM MUST announce the stage-up via a [SYS_NARR:...] tag. The narration MUST reference the stage''s <효과명> as the "기운" (aura) that begins to permeate the island.

Examples:
[SYS_NARR: 🏝 섬 개발 단계 상승 - ''황무지''→''개척지''<br>첫 시설이 세워졌습니다. 섬에 <생존>의 기운이 감돌기 시작합니다.<br>► 개척지 효과: 보급품 가챠가 부족한 스탯 회복 아이템으로 보정됨 (Lua 자동 적용)]
[SYS_NARR: 🏝 섬 개발 단계 상승 - ''개척지''→''마을''<br>시설이 3개에 달했습니다. 섬에 <안정>의 기운이 감돌기 시작합니다.<br>► 마을 효과: 하루 허기 소모 -20% (Lua 자동 적용)]
[SYS_NARR: 🏝 섬 개발 단계 상승 - ''마을''→''요새''<br>시설이 5개에 달했습니다. 섬에 <정복>의 기운이 감돌기 시작합니다.<br>► 요새 효과: 전투 성공률 +10% (Lua 자동 적용)]
[SYS_NARR: 🏝 섬 개발 단계 상승 - ''요새''→''왕국''<br>시설이 7개에 달했습니다. 섬에 <풍요>의 기운이 감돌기 시작합니다.<br>► 왕국 효과: 모든 회복 효과 +20% (HP/마나/허기, AI 계산 적용)]
[SYS_NARR: 🏝 섬 개발 단계 상승 - ''왕국''→''성지''<br>시설이 10개에 달했습니다. 섬에 <창세>의 기운이 감돌기 시작합니다.<br>► 성지 효과: 최대 체력/마나/허기 +100 영구 (Lua 자동 적용)]

## Effect Details

### Stage 1 - 개척지 <생존>: Supply gacha bias
The Lua backend (gachaSupply) checks cv_hp / cv_mana / cv_hunger ratios and forces 카테고리_2 to match the lowest stat:
- HP < 100% (lowest) → 카테고리_2 = HP회복
- MANA < 100% (lowest) → 카테고리_2 = 마나회복
- HUNGER < 100% (lowest) → 카테고리_2 = 배고픔회복
- All three at 100% → random as normal
The GM does NOT need to do this calculation. Just generate the supply item per the [GACHA_CATS:보급품|...|카테고리_2] tag delivered.
In narration, hint at it naturally - e.g., "the island seems to know what you needed."

### Stage 2 - 마을 <안정>: Hunger drain -20%
The Lua backend applies this automatically during NEW_DAY processing. The GM does NOT need to output a HUNGER tag.
In narration, hint at it naturally - e.g., "settled life has improved food management."

### Stage 3 - 요새 <정복>: Combat success rate +10%
Lua onInput automatically reflects +10% when calculating cv_combatRate.
In narration, hint at it naturally - e.g., "the island''s defensive training environment has sharpened combat instincts."

### Stage 4 - 왕국 <풍요>: All recovery +20%
When cv_islandStage >= 4, the GM MUST multiply ALL HP / MANA / HUNGER recovery values by ×1.2 (round to integer) before outputting the [SYSTEM|HP:+N] / [SYSTEM|MANA:+N] / [SYSTEM|HUNGER:+N] tag.
Applies to: supply item use, relic effects, facility effects, floor condition (축복받은 땅), any other recovery source.
Does NOT apply to: damage taken, mana cost, hunger drain (those are reductions, not recovery).
Calculation order: base × relics × facilities × stage4(1.2). Stacks multiplicatively with relic/facility bonuses.
Example: A potion that normally restores HP +20 → on stage 4, output [SYSTEM|HP:+24 포션 사용 (왕국 효과)]. A mana potion +15 with relic ×1.2 → 15 × 1.2 × 1.2 = 21 → [SYSTEM|MANA:+21 마나 회복 (유물 + 왕국)].
In narration, hint at it naturally - e.g., "the island''s abundant aura amplifies the restoration."

### Stage 5 - 성지 <창세>: MAX HP/MANA/HUNGER +100 (Permanent)
The instant cv_islandStage transitions from 4→5 for the first time, Lua automatically increases cv_maxHp / cv_maxMana / cv_maxHunger by +100 each (permanent). Simultaneously, current cv_hp / cv_mana / cv_hunger are also raised by +100 so ratios remain unchanged (e.g., 80/100 → 180/200, still 80%).
- One-time only: Guarded by cv_stage5MaxApplied to prevent duplicate application. Even if stage drops 5→4 and returns to 5, the bonus is NOT re-applied (and not revoked either - permanent reward).
- No AI handling required: Lua handles all stat changes automatically. The AI MUST NOT directly output [SYSTEM|MAX_HP:+100] / [SYSTEM|MAX_MANA:+100] / [SYSTEM|MAX_HUNGER:+100] / [SYSTEM|HP:+100] etc. tags (Lua applies these silently; duplicate output causes double application).
- Narration guide: Right after the stage 5 first-reach SYS_NARR, narrate naturally - e.g., 「섬의 창세가 {{user}}와 동료들의 그릇 자체를 넓힌다 - 체력·마나·허기 한계가 모두 100씩 늘어났다」 정도. Flow it with the main-ending narration.
- On re-entry: Already +100-applied, so just output the stage-up narration with no extra bonus.

### Stage 5 First Reach - Main Ending Trigger (MAIN GOAL COMPLETION)
When cv_islandStage transitions from 4 → 5 for the very first time, this is the game''s MAIN ENDING. The GM MUST output a special celebratory ending [SYS_NARR:...] right after the stage transition narration. Suggested format:
[SYS_NARR: 🌌 - ENDING - 가챠섬 메인 엔딩 도달<br>► 황무지였던 섬을 ''성지''까지 키워내셨네요. 이게 이 게임의 ''엔딩''입니다. 짠~ ♪<br>► 메인 목표는 끝났지만, 여기서 멈출 필요는 없어요. 던전·가챠·동료·시설 - 전부 그대로니까요.<br>► 자유 플레이 모드로 전환됩니다. 마음껏 굴려 보세요~ ♪]
- Tone: keep the usual mischievous, teasing GM tone. This is a milestone named "ENDING", not the actual end of the game (≠ GAME OVER).
- Output timing: include in the same response right after the 4→5 transition SYS_NARR.
- Anti-repeat: output ONLY on the first stage 5 entry. Once stage 5 is reached, the ending SYS_NARR is permanently a one-time event.
- Post-ending gameplay: dungeon / gacha / companions / facilities / hunger / HP all continue normally. Sandbox free play. cv_islandStage stays at 5; the +100 MAX bonus remains permanent.
